%% 2026-08-03: repo_improvement_researcher sub-agent enabled by default; routing skills expanded with repo improvement, ecosystem upgrade, dependency upgrade, and scout keywords.
%% 2026-07-14: ShoppingBridge added: StoreProvider interface, StoreProviderRegistry (priority-based selection), AmazonStoreProvider scaffold, and PersonalShopperService (provider-agnostic orchestration with budget/seller-threshold safety invariants).
%% Build quality tooling: JaCoCo test-coverage reporting and SonarQube static-analysis added in build.gradle.kts.
%% 2026-07-13: Calendar response formatting now performs MCP envelope unwrapping and readable event rendering in ToolCallingSkill.
%% 2026-07-13: Runtime tool-calling now uses explicit integration registry and validates required sub-agent -> tool integration coverage at startup.
%% 2026-07-14: MacrofactorToolRouter wired into RuntimeFactory as a RuntimeToolIntegration via buildRuntimeToolIntegrations.
%% 2026-07-14: ExternalChatFollowupSender added for outbound platform replies (Telegram/Slack/WhatsApp/Discord); wired via WebhookMain into ExternalChatPayloadDispatcher.
%% 2026-07-14: External chat follow-up async execution now uses Kotlin coroutines (SupervisorJob + Dispatchers.IO), and follow-up send failures are logged for observability.
%% 2026-07-14: Telegram follow-up sender supports API base URL override for local endpoint tests and retries once without reply_to_message_id when Telegram rejects threaded replies.
%% 2026-07-14: ExternalChatPayloadDispatcher now emits platform fallback final messages even when adapter generation throws, preventing status-only dead ends.
%% 2026-07-14: Polymarket runtime tool schemas now publish strict operation enums per API family to prevent unsupported operation calls in webhook tool-calling loops.
%% 2026-07-14: ToolCallingSkill now performs deterministic operation inference for operation-enum tools (Polymarket) using user-intent keyword aliases and argument hints before executing tool calls.
%% 2026-07-14: Shopping workflow stages (onboarding, recommendation, compare, cart_prepare, checkout_prepare) added to architecture. RuntimeCapabilitySnapshot now includes persistenceBackend, playwrightFallbackAvailable, and shoppingProviderAvailable fields. Capability status response reports store backend, Playwright fallback, and store provider status.
%% 2026-07-14: Optional Playwright browser store adapter added (disabled by default). Supports api/browser/hybrid per-store mode with AllowedBrowserActionPolicy allowlist and graceful recommendation-only fallback.
%% 2026-07-14: ShoppingToolRouter added with operations search/details/compare/cart_prepare/checkout_prepare; hard-blocks place_order; enforces budget and seller-trust guardrails; requires confirmation_token for state-changing ops.
%% 2026-07-14: ShoppingRuntimeConfiguration added with indexed store slots (BERTBOT_SHOPPING_STORE_N_*); personal_shopper sub-agent registered (disabled by default); validateShoppingConfiguration enforces startup guard when personal_shopper is enabled without a configured store.
%% 2026-07-14: Shopping runtime configuration declarations consolidated in BertBotSupport so global shopping flags and indexed store-slot settings are resolved together.
%% 2026-08-03: Env variable consolidation: toBooleanEnv extracted to BertBotEnvironmentSettings as a shared internal function; resolveWorkspaceRoot now honours .env fallback; BERTBOT_SLACK_ENABLED and BERTBOT_WHATSAPP_ENABLED default to false to match .env.example.
%% 2026-08-04: Runtime now uses a single CapabilityRegistry + UnifiedToolBus pipeline; execution profiles can scope tool visibility/execution by selected sub-agent.
%% 2026-08-04: Shopping router is now service-backed through PersonalShopperService and seeded AmazonStoreProvider catalog data rather than placeholder-only responses.
%% 2026-08-04: Phase 1 graph stages now include ResearchPlannerNode, EvidenceJudgeNode, and SafetyGuardianNode before delegation/execution.
%% 2026-08-04: Phase 2/3 graph stages now include ModelRouterNode, IncidentDetectorNode, and IncidentCommanderNode.
%% 2026-08-04: Runtime now resolves ModelRouter-selected model IDs per turn for both direct responses and tool-calling loops, with traceable fallback reasons.
%% 2026-08-04: Hermes parity slice adds scoped session-history search/list/clear tooling and durable learning-review approval queues with apply-failure metadata.
